          "url": "https://github.com/bmdavis419/.better-coding-agents/blob/9a1709fa3b7f92343574d8008ce949263da9c82f/README.md#L26-L26"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c6502cb3348f5c9e343f0541ebf6432a0ab1f440ffcfa9ea3df1cfe106e682c6"
      ],
      "text": "An init command configures the user's machine by upserting OpenCode commands and agents and Cursor commands, updating existing files or creating new ones."
    },
